; `account` is not a query keyword: match_keyword has no `account`
; entry, so a bare `account` is an account-name pattern like any other
; term (it matches Assets:Accounts Receivable), and `account food` ORs
; two patterns.  coverage-query-account-keyword.test and
; testQueryLexerAccountNotKeyword use journals where no account name
; contains "account", so they print the same either way.

2024/01/01 Client
    Assets:Accounts Receivable    $25.00
    Income:Fees

2024/01/02 Grocer
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal account
              $25.00  Assets:Accounts Receivable
end test

test bal account food
              $25.00  Assets:Accounts Receivable
              $10.00  Expenses:Food
--------------------
              $35.00
end test
